WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.930
Signing up for a shift happens right on the open spots board. It takes a few taps. The game in this video is made up, to show how it works.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:14.642
Open spots shows every game. Filter by sport at the top.

00:00:14.842 --> 00:00:18.683
The calendar shows each game, and how many spots are still open.

00:00:18.883 --> 00:00:25.360
Tap a game. Here, it's IU Men's Soccer versus Notre Dame, on Sunday the twenty-second.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:31.523
The game shows when sign-up closes. Each stand lists its positions, with their times.

00:00:31.723 --> 00:00:34.283
Students O K means anyone can take it.

00:00:34.483 --> 00:00:41.503
Alcohol permit spots are for adults with a permit on file. A full spot offers Join waitlist instead.

00:00:41.703 --> 00:00:44.470
Read the stand's notes before you go.

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:50.163
Tap I'll work this, and pick who's working it. Everyone saved on this phone is listed.

00:00:50.363 --> 00:00:52.241
Pick which student gets the credit,

00:00:52.441 --> 00:00:55.365
and the program, if it's different from the one on file.

00:00:55.565 --> 00:00:57.790
Then tap I'll work this.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:01.457
You're on! A confirmation email is on its way.

00:01:01.657 --> 00:01:06.360
Add it to your calendar. It updates on its own if the time changes.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:11.989
Back on the board, your spot has a check mark, with Hand off and Cancel my spot.

00:01:12.189 --> 00:01:15.582
It's one spot per person per game, and the board says so.

00:01:15.782 --> 00:01:24.560
Spots that nobody on this phone can take are greyed out, with the reason. Here, Riley is a student, so the alcohol spots are out.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:32.792
Spot full? Join the waitlist. If a spot opens before sign-up closes, you're signed up and emailed automatically.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:36.970
Anyone who can't take that spot is greyed out in the list.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:41.938
Can't make it? Tap Hand off, and pass your spot to a spouse or a friend.

00:01:42.138 --> 00:01:47.010
They get an email to accept. Until they do, the spot stays yours.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:57.490
Sign-up closes before the game. After that there's no cancelling. Use Hand off, or contact the IU liaison, so the stand isn't short.
